    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯けむりは、硫黄と檜の匂い。大会の翌週は、湯だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "勝っても負けても、砂は流すもの。三年目のうちの、決まりごとだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、骨休め——のはずだった。玄関で、あの仲居さんが三つ指をついた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お待ちしておりました。三度目ですね」数えている。毎年、正しく数えている。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯に浸かって、それとなく聞いてみた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「暦が巻き戻っても、覚えているんですね」仲居さんは平然と、桶を並べる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「湯の中の話は、湯の外へ持ち出さないのが決まりです」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「湯の中でなら、何を話しても大丈夫」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この湯、そういう決まりの場所だったのか。道理で、常連さんの愚痴が深い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お客さま、来た口でしょう」来た口? ……え。耳が、ぴくっと動く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「——空から。私も、です」桶を置く音が、こん、と軽く鳴った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯気の向こうの背中は、仕事の姿勢のまま。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空から来た者だけが、変なところに気づける。ずっと、自分ひとりの持病だと思ってた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同じ持病の先輩が、三年黙って湯を沸かしてた。「三度目ですね」は、同類の挨拶だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯の中の決まりに甘えて、話をした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白手袋の数えごとのこと。仲居さんの桶が、止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「回収局まで、出てきたんですか」「——それ、勝てますよ」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あなたを持ち物にした取り決め、女神さまの判が無いままでしょう」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「**来た口が束になれば、ひっくり返せる**んです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「湯の中では、昔からそう言われています」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "束になれば、って。どこにいるんですか、その人たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w05.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞くより先に、膳が来た。卵は、固めだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ],
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w05.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week",
      "_units": 1
    }
  ],
